Z||000011||Brandon86SE||09-27-2001||02:57 AM||||I missed it 'cause I was at work, but a friend taped it (I didn't even know when it aired).  I got to watch it this afternoon.  I thought it was great!  I can't wait to see some more episodes, and make sure they have plenty of ideas.  Oh, and she is damn hot!  I've kind of given up on TV in the past year, except for sporting events, but I think I might have a regular show to watch again!  I liked TNG, and original, but didn't care much for Voyager and DS9.  I hope this is good!<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
