Z||000013||mrfixit58||09-27-2001||08:22 AM||||From what I saw, I liked it. I missed the first 30 minutes and a few minutes here and there (wife's B-day, kiddie's bed time, etc). I agree with the earlier comment about the Vulcan. Slap a blond wig one he and she becomes a 7-of-9 clone. I'm guessing her character will soften as the season progresses (Remember how tense Spock was in the early episodes?).<P>The gadgets were pretty cool. I thought the transporter scene could have used a little more build-up. Did they cover that earlier in the show? Only other comment is the interior of the ship and number of crewmen seem out of proportion to outer size of ship.<P>Otherwise, good!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||14
