Z||000034||My7Fieros||09-30-2001||02:05 AM||||Holy Sh!t, THATS the Star Trek chick on the Maxim cover!? GULP! I watched the show (and still didnt recognize her on the mag cover, go figure) and really liked it for the most part. <BR>It looks like its getting me back into the Star Trek thing...(I used to be a major Trekkie). Since I played hookie from work tonight (um, I mean, Im sick, yeah, thats it) I blew the dust off my Star Trek Generations movie and First Contact movie and whatched them. <BR>I agree about the fact that they never mention nor show any pics of NX-01 in previous episodes/movies...oh well. <BR>The show is gonna be great, no doubt, and Im sure we'll see the "growth/developement" of the characters in time.<BR>Backula an overactor?...NOOOO. Scott Backula (IMHO) was the PERFECT choice! Deborah Messing (Will and Grace) and that turd that plays John on Days of Our lives (my g/f watches it...really  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) are overactors...Backula is great.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||10
